<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>My Sample Webpage</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
            color: #333;
        }
        header, footer {
            background: #f4f4f4;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }
        nav a {
            margin-right: 15px;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #0066cc;
        }
        form {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 10px;
            max-width: 400px;
        }
        input, textarea, button {
            padding: 8px;
            font-size: 1rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h1>Welcome to My Website</h1>
        <nav>
            <a href="#about">About</a>
            <a href="#features">Features</a>
            <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
        <section id="about">
            <h2>About This Page</h2>
            <p>This is a standard <strong>HTML5</strong> template. You can save this code as an <code>index.html</code> file and open it in any web browser.</p>
        </section>

        <section id="features">
            <h2>Key Elements Included</h2>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Semantic Tags:</strong> Uses <code>&lt;header&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;main&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;section&gt;</code>, and <code>&lt;footer&gt;</code>.</li>
                <li><strong>Basic Styling:</strong> Includes internal CSS inside the <code>&lt;style&gt;</code> tag.</li>
                <li><strong>Interactive Form:</strong> Features text inputs and a submit button.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section id="contact">
            <h2>Contact Us</h2>
            <form action="#" method="post">
                <label for="name">Name:</label>
                <input type="text" id="name" name="name" placeholder="Enter your name" required>

                <label for="email">Email:</label>
                <input type="email" id="email" name="email" placeholder="Enter your email" required>

                <label for="message">Message:</label>
                <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="4" placeholder="Write your message..."></textarea>

                <button type="submit">Send Message</button>
            </form>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 My Sample Website. Learn more at <a href="https://www.w3schools.com/html/" target="_blank">W3Schools</a>.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
